tenance."}, {"image": "/wp-content/uploads/product-catalog/motorcycles/Idling_Stop_System_dev_two.png", "title": "IDLING STOP SYSTEM", "description": "Its smart Idling Stop System automatically switches off the engine at quick stops like traffic lights saving you some fuel!\\r\\n"}, {"image": "/wp-content/uploads/product-catalog/motorcycles/Inteligent_Meter_dev_two.png", "title": "SMART DIGITAL METER", "description": "The all-new Dio equipped with the smart digital meter tracks real-time mileage, average mileage and distance to empty and lets you ride smarter!\\r\\n"}, {"image": "/wp-content/uploads/product-catalog/motorcycles/PGM_FI_system_dev_two.png", "title": "PGM-FI SYSTEM", "description": "The smart sensor activated PGM-FI system fills optimum fuel with air for highly efficient combustion resulting in consistent power and more mileage. \\r\\n"}, {"image": "/wp-content/uploads/product-catalog/motorcycles/Side_Stand_Engine_Cut_Off_dev_two.png", "title": "SIDE STAND ENGINE CUT OFF", "description": "For your safety, the smart new Dio 125 turns off the engine when the side stand is in use. "}, {"image": "/wp-content/uploads/product-catalog/motorcycles/Smart_Key_dev_two.png", "title": "SMART KEY(only in DLX variant)", "description": "The all-new Honda Dio 125 uses H-Smart technology for Smart Key. this lets you enjoy features like Smart Safe, Smart Find, Smart Unlock and Smart Start. "}, {"image": "/wp-content/uploads/product-catalog/motorcycles/Headlamp_and_Split_LED_Position_Lamp_dev_two.png", "title": "SPLIT LED POSITION LAMP AND HEADLAMP", "description": "Split LED position lamp and Headlamp brightens the looks of your bold and sporty Honda Dio 125."}, {"image": "/wp-content/uploads/product-catalog/motorcycles/Sporty_Tail_Light_dev_two.png", "title": "SPORTY TAIL LIGHT", "description": "A sporty tail light to make the whole world give a second glance to your stunning ride.\\r\\n"}, {"image": "/wp-content/uploads/product-catalog/motorcycles/Dual_Tip_Muffler_dev_t